   },
   {
    "en": "30 cm behind the mirror, virtual, 3 times magnified"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 3,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "u = −10 cm, f = −15 cm: 1/v = 1/f − 1/u = −1/15 + 1/10 = 1/30, so v = +30 cm (behind, virtual). m = −v/u = +3."
  },
