    "en": "20 cm"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 2,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "Real image: m = −2 = −v/u, so v = 2u = −30 cm. 1/f = 1/v + 1/u = −1/30 − 1/15 = −1/10, so |f| = 10 cm."
